 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You found my garden.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Garden?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "These are the plants I tend.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Some bear fruit. Some only thorns.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "What are they?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Records. Of land. Of grain. Of taxes. Of temple offerings. Of letters.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Of men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You write this of me?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I would be negligent if I did not. You are a piece on the board.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Pieces can be lost in many ways. I keep track.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He worries about his soul. That is useful to know.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And you keep such lists on everyone? Even the king?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Especially the king. He understands that forgetting is a luxury small kingdoms cannot afford.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You watch us all.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Is that not... exhausting?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It is what I know how to do. You count men and hooves. I count tendencies.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Between us, perhaps we keep this place alive.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You write of my loyalties. Do you write of your own?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Of course. Only not where anyone else can read.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Does it not feel like spying? Keeping such close watch on men who trust you?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Spying is what others call watching when they disapprove of the watchers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I call it preparation. Goodwill is a poor shield. Knowledge is better.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Knowledge can twist. It can make you cut men down before they have done anything, because you fear they might.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You speak like someone who has seen that happen.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off, from the archive)"
   ],
   "text": "In Pune, I watched a sardar order a loyal captain executed because a Brahmin said the stars looked wrong.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He had heard a rumour that the captain admired another chief. That rumour became fact in his mind because fear and jealousy filled the gaps.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The supposed traitor never even drew his sword.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Fear is my enemy too. That is why I write.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It gives fear less room to invent.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "When a chief whispers that Revathi plots against the king, I can see that she has refused three offers from Dutch factors in the last month.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I do not have to guess.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You fear that one day you will open a letter from your brother, and I will be reading over your shoulder.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Should I not?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If I decide to keep you from riding north, it will not be because of a letter.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It will be because the balance of this kingdom requires it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If I decide it is better to let you go, it will be for the same reason.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You are one line in a very long text.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Does it not trouble you, to think of people as lines on leaves?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Sometimes. Then I walk in the market. I eat at Padmini's hearth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "That keeps me from becoming what you fear. Or so I hope.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You are disturbed. That is good. Men who are comfortable being watched are either fools or tyrants.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And you? Which are you?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (in the inset)"
   ],
   "text": "I am tired. And determined. That is all.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Why show me this? You could have sent me away.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Because you walk with half your weight in the north and half here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I married into Velinadu. I sent my brother the final gold. I am here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Marriages end. Gold runs out. Roots are harder to kill than branches.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You are not just a man who trains horses. You are a potential message. A symbol. A warning.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It is better you see how I measure that than imagine monsters where there are only old men with styluses.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I have already seen three serious attempts to cut the king's life short.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "We caught those because someone, somewhere in these leaves, had written a warning in time.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I would rather fill shelves than graves.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  }
 ]
}